Allocates memory aligned to the specified boundary. The alignment must be a power of 2. If alignment is 0, uses default_alignment_.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classcslt_1_1HeapAllocator" kindref="compound">cslt::HeapAllocator</ref><sp/>allocator;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
