<para>Frees all allocations and resets the allocator to its initial state. Default is a no-op. Allocators that own memory override this to actually reset their state. After reset, all previous pointers are invalid.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classcslt_1_1ArenaAllocator" kindref="compound">cslt::ArenaAllocator</ref><sp/>allocator(1024);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
