<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ptr2<sp/>=<sp/>allocator.alloc(256,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">false</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Before<sp/>reset:<sp/>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>allocator.size()<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;\n&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>384</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">allocator.reset();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;After<sp/>reset:<sp/>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>allocator.size()<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;\n&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>0</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>ptr1<sp/>and<sp/>ptr2<sp/>are<sp/>now<sp/>INVALID<sp/>-<sp/>do<sp/>not<sp/>use!</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Can<sp/>allocate<sp/>again<sp/>from<sp/>fresh<sp/>state</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ptr3<sp/>=<sp/>allocator.alloc(512,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">false</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
